# *Ways to Contact Dr. Voss*

@body

- [Attend Office Hours]{color=green}
- [Discord]{color=red}
  - by far the quickest, check multiple times per day\
    you can send direct message (DM) to me or post to the whole class\
    Response time\: 1-2 calendar days.
- [Email]{color=blue}: [_nvoss@roosevelt.edu_](mailto:nvoss@roosevelt.edu).
  - I receive 20 emails per day and only check once per day for mental health reasons\
    Response time\: 2 business days.
- [Anonymous Google Form]{color=purple}.
  - goes to my email, but I can only read on laptop\
    Response time\: 2-4 business days.

